msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"I finally got a Ryukyu sea bream! Once Kazuo-chan hears about this, he'll be"
" a regular for life..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Hey. You the one who bought a Ryukyu sea bream at the Public Market?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Huh? Yeah, that was me, all right. Why do you ask?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Somebody else had already reserved that fish. I'm gonna have to buy it back "
"from you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"No way! It took me forever to score this baby! My regular's gonna get the "
"feast he deserves!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"You sure you won't change your mind? That fishmonger's prepared to offer "
"twice what you paid for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"Twice? Wow, he must really want it bad. Then again, I guess I kinda bullied "
"him into selling it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Okay, how about triple what I paid for it? 300,000 yen? Oughta be enough for"
" me to find a good replacement fish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "300,000 yen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"Of course, we could always make a trade. If you can catch a tuna or "
"something, I'll swap for the sea bream."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Okay, then... 300,000 yen for your Ryukyu sea bream."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "All right. A deal's a deal. Here you go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "You paid <Color:8>300,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai pagato <Color:8>50.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "412"
msgid "You bought the <Color:8>Ryukyu Sea Bream<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "(Now to get this back to the fishmonger at the Public Market.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "All right. A deal's a deal. So, where's that cash?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "(Damn. I don't have enough on me.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"What, a little light in the ol' pocketbook? I'll just wait here while you "
"top it off, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"(I guess I'll have to head back to the fishmonger at the Public Market for "
"now.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Sure, why not? I think I can catch you a whopper."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"Now we're talking! And I want a real lunker, see? Some storebought shrimp "
"fresh off the ice ain't gonna cut it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"Don't worry, I'm on it. I'll get you the perfect fish if it's the last thing"
" I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"It's not my decision to make. I'll go ask the fishmonger at the Public "
"Market."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid ""
"You go do that. Don't worry⑬I'll hold off on this sea bream until we figure "
"it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"(I guess I'll have to head back to the fishmonger at the Public Market for "
"now.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Oh, you're back! About time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"So what's it going to be? You paying up, or catching my fish? Cash... or "
"char?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "300,000 yen for your Ryukyu sea bream."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "All right. A deal's a deal. Here you go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "You paid <Color:8>300,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai pagato <Color:8>50.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "628"
msgid "You got the <Color:8>Ryukyu Sea Bream<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "(Now to get this back to the fishmonger at the Public Market.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "All right. A deal's a deal. So where's the cash?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "(Damn. I don't have enough on me.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid ""
"What, a little light in the ol' pocketbook? I'll just wait here while you "
"top it off, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid ""
"(I guess I'll have to head back to the fishmonger at the Public Market for "
"now.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "(Uh-oh... I'm going to have to earn back that 300,000 yen myself.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid ""
"I've got another fish for you. Take a look. Is it up to your standards?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "What are you thinking? I don't want some slimy snail!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid ""
"You've gotta be kidding me... You could pick this up at any old market!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid ""
"If you want this Ryukyu sea bream, I need a fish you can't just buy "
"anywhere. Even a fresh-caught tuna could do the trick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "All right. A deal's a deal. I'll be back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid ""
"Hmm... Well, it's nice and fresh, that's for sure, but it's not quite what I"
" was expecting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid ""
"How about a tuna, or something more along those lines? This one just isn't "
"cutting it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "All right. A deal's a deal. I'll be back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid ""
"Wow! Now that's what I call a fish! Who needs a Ryukyu sea bream when you "
"have a catch like this baby!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid "The sea bream is all yours, friend. I'm a man of my word."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid "You handed over a <Color:8>Maguro<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid "You got the <Color:8>Ryukyu Sea Bream<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid "(Now to get this back to the fishmonger at the Public Market.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid ""
"Could you wait just a little longer? I'll go catch you a first-class fish."
msgstr ""

